                    "mood": "thinking",
                    "cta": "Even braking?"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "l3",
                    "text": "Even braking. A bus going round a corner at a steady speed is accelerating as well.",
                    "mood": "surprised",
                    "cta": "Because the direction changes?"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "l4",
                    "text": "Exactly that. Direction is part of velocity, so changing it counts.",
                    "mood": "cheer",
                    "cta": "Got it"
                  }
